Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "EmptyNightIntersectionWithBillboards" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :billboard1, :billboard2 ;
    :hasRisk :distractionRisk1, :occlusionRisk1, :roadConditionRisk1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :nightCondition1 .

:billboard1 a :Billboard ;
    :description "Billboard advertising a shoe store with bright lights" .

:billboard2 a :Billboard ;
    :description "Billboard with colorful graphics and lights" .

:nightCondition1 a :NightCondition .

:distractionRisk1 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Bright billboards may distract drivers at night" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:occlusionRisk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Darkness and lack of actors may cause sensor occlusion" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:roadConditionRisk1 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Wet road surface may affect vehicle handling" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.35"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.40"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.25"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

